{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s31abb35a94dac2ca","language":"en","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-e77b0517dc55f210c7d5","text":"Did the Synthesizer explode?","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4c12636efcd1dda0973a","text":"Did the Synthesizer explode?","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7d456e82863bfeb327c5","text":"...No.","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cb170f936ecd6c9be20f","text":"It's just a few orders of Yucky Fried Rice. It won't explode that easily.","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3858b96f65ee03509315","text":"...No.","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6026f8723e261c18f83d","text":"If I did, I'd be obliged to start writing the Seven Enigmas of Astral Express.","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0c6370453b4380d2bbd7","text":"You can't find Pom-Pom?","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-dd0b6186018a1a60ce27","text":"You can't find Pom-Pom?","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5f3262af1d58f1a1f780","text":"...No.","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3dd0a49a239bcbd781de","text":"That's a scary thought. I can't even imagine the Express without Pom-Pom","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3195238705725d3b8776","text":"Wait, why would you ask a question like that :(","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-534af091b01dc5dab113","text":"I'm just curious about what you're doing","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-62402f607c48f1025683","text":"I'm grinding Calyxes!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-200942c078b0d35a3cc9","text":"I'm grinding Calyxes!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a6382087be34250347f9","text":"Um... Did you even sleep?","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4190b5a2c28396242e41","text":"Credits or Light Cones?","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7a9f2e0881dc0a01138a","text":"[Trailblazer] must've been working really hard, huh?","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f31618699bb1c89ceb75","text":"Need some company?","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-52fa20a2f3224b9aab1a","text":"Sure!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e3dc4c7d54ce6f36c50","text":"Yay. I'm coming!","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-305b4ace6a5e1c590fc5","text":"I'm doing Assignments!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-17058316ea23c3696e3c","text":"I'm doing Assignments!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0ab9c40100a8656c3c48","text":"Wow... You're so proactive...","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0158cc107b4711cfc3a2","text":"[Trailblazer] is a qualified member of the Nameless!","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c92f824dac9c118a88c1","text":"If you found any fun Assignments, don't forget to bring me along!","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e7246c7688d8bba228b3","text":"Sure!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c65037253a437ad99504","text":"I'm... not doing anything!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-266eaa43a1a1071cb79f","text":"I'm... not doing anything!","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0898e9612982b954b4be","text":"Oh, are you that free?","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ac75835d64ab061d201b","text":"[Trailblazer], if you're that free, why don't you come back to the Express?","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7eebbd09e72eee4de863","text":"We can chat a bit","speaker":"March 7th"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-990975cc461c41f01230","text":"Sure!","speaker":""}]}
